{"5044910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Quest", "steam_appid": 5044910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Quest is a dungeon‑crawling RPG with an old‑school soul, blending first‑person exploration with tactical, line‑drawing combat. Step into a labyrinth of shifting halls, hidden chambers, and ancient secrets as you descend deeper into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate twisting dungeons, uncover hidden rooms, and gather loot that fuels your growth. Every step drags you deeper into a world where traps sharpen, monsters evolve, and the margin for survival narrows with every floor you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/ede62106d9e14a827a4c7523bad3afea.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/ede62106d9e14a827a4c7523bad3afea.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/ede62106d9e14a827a4c7523bad3afea.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds on a gameboard where every move matters. Trace lines across matching tiles to strike enemies and collect resources. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords matched with skulls unleash attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potions restore your health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields reinforce your armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins unlock powerful upgrades that reshape your strategy and define your build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/61a6fe666a0171db1b267f8f00ca5d04.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/61a6fe666a0171db1b267f8f00ca5d04.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/61a6fe666a0171db1b267f8f00ca5d04.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gather resources, you’ll upgrade your hero and unlock special abilities that transform how you fight. Build synergies, manipulate the board, and chain devastating combos as your power grows. Each run in this roguelite offers opportunities to try different combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/334f8a42a3fefea8e01765cd177cea5e.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/334f8a42a3fefea8e01765cd177cea5e.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/334f8a42a3fefea8e01765cd177cea5e.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers new challenges. Dungeons shift each time you play, with different abilities to choose from and escalating difficulty modes to test your skill. Lose yourself for hours as you chase powerful builds, push deeper, and unlock every achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/719feb7b2feb9a6a386a61052f5e053d.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/719feb7b2feb9a6a386a61052f5e053d.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/719feb7b2feb9a6a386a61052f5e053d.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ways to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new classes including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Warrior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleric</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each offering unique abilities and distinct playstyles. Whether you favor brute force, clever manipulation, or intricate ability chains, there’s a class to match your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend, grow, and survive. The monsters below won’t go quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Quest is a dungeon‑crawling RPG with an old‑school soul, blending first‑person exploration with tactical, line‑drawing combat. Step into a labyrinth of shifting halls, hidden chambers, and ancient secrets as you descend deeper into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate twisting dungeons, uncover hidden rooms, and gather loot that fuels your growth. Every step drags you deeper into a world where traps sharpen, monsters evolve, and the margin for survival narrows with every floor you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/ede62106d9e14a827a4c7523bad3afea.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/ede62106d9e14a827a4c7523bad3afea.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/ede62106d9e14a827a4c7523bad3afea.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds on a gameboard where every move matters. Trace lines across matching tiles to strike enemies and collect resources. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords matched with skulls unleash attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potions restore your health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shields reinforce your armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins unlock powerful upgrades that reshape your strategy and define your build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/61a6fe666a0171db1b267f8f00ca5d04.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/61a6fe666a0171db1b267f8f00ca5d04.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/61a6fe666a0171db1b267f8f00ca5d04.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gather resources, you’ll upgrade your hero and unlock special abilities that transform how you fight. Build synergies, manipulate the board, and chain devastating combos as your power grows. Each run in this roguelite offers opportunities to try different combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/334f8a42a3fefea8e01765cd177cea5e.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/334f8a42a3fefea8e01765cd177cea5e.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/334f8a42a3fefea8e01765cd177cea5e.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers new challenges. Dungeons shift each time you play, with different abilities to choose from and escalating difficulty modes to test your skill. Lose yourself for hours as you chase powerful builds, push deeper, and unlock every achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/719feb7b2feb9a6a386a61052f5e053d.poster.avif?t=1786835687\" width=780 height=596 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/719feb7b2feb9a6a386a61052f5e053d.webm?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/extras/719feb7b2feb9a6a386a61052f5e053d.mp4?t=1786835687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ways to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new classes including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Warrior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleric</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each offering unique abilities and distinct playstyles. Whether you favor brute force, clever manipulation, or intricate ability chains, there’s a class to match your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend, grow, and survive. The monsters below won’t go quietly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "By tracing lines across matching tiles on the gameboard to battle foes and gather resources, Dungeon Quest delivers a dungeon‑crawling turn‑based RPG with an old‑school soul. Explore the depths, uncover secrets, gather loot, and grow your arsenal of unique abilities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/b606be7ef086b0718a06543ab66439c969356ebc/header.jpg?t=1786835687", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/b16b93ae8611f8b1c8a55f07f178d03ac3840676/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786835687", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5044910/b16b93ae8611f8b1c8a55f07f178d03ac3840676/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786835687", "website": "http://www.destined.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support (Intel Core i5 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any standard soundcard!</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-750 (quad-core) / A